  "description": "<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"391\">Rayman Legends Definitive Edition is een kleurrijke en razendsnelle <strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"141\">platformgame</strong> waarin je samen met Rayman en zijn vrienden door fantasierijke werelden rent, springt en vecht. Deze Definitive Edition bevat alle content uit de originele game, aangevuld met exclusieve Switch-features zoals lokale multiplayer en extra uitdagingen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"562\">De game staat bekend om zijn vloeiende gameplay, handgetekende graphics en perfecte balans tussen toegankelijkheid en uitdaging. Ideaal voor zowel solo als co-op spelen.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"567\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"578\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"597\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"619\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<li data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"669\">🎮 Geschikt voor 1 tot 4 spelers (lokale co-op)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"707\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"707\">🌈 Prachtige handgetekende graphics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"746\">🕹️ Soepele en responsieve besturing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"790\">🧠 Veel variatie in levels en uitdagingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"848\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Perfect voor zowel kinderen als volwassenen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"875\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<li data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"905\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"929\">Genre: Platformgame</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"955\">Spelers: 1–4 (lokaal)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"994\">\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"994\">Taal: Meertalig (incl. Nederlands)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1016\">Uitgever: Ubisoft</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1047\">Editie: Definitive Edition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1073\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1098\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1116\">Gamecartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1137\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1166\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1203\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1203\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
